Subject: [PATCH 07/18] MaxWidth, MaxHeight, MinWidth and MinHeight close the
 parenthesis of fit-content(x) (swift-w3c/swift-w3c-css#13)

---
 Sources/W3C CSS BoxModel/MaxHeight.swift      |  2 +-
 Sources/W3C CSS BoxModel/MaxWidth.swift       |  2 +-
 Sources/W3C CSS BoxModel/MinHeight.swift      |  2 +-
 Sources/W3C CSS BoxModel/MinWidth.swift       |  2 +-
 .../MaxHeight Tests.swift                     | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../MaxWidth Tests.swift                      | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../MinHeight Tests.swift                     | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../MinWidth Tests.swift                      | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 8 files changed, 80 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Tests/W3C CSS BoxModel Tests/MaxHeight Tests.swift
 create mode 100644 Tests/W3C CSS BoxModel Tests/MaxWidth Tests.swift
 create mode 100644 Tests/W3C CSS BoxModel Tests/MinHeight Tests.swift
